---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="找不到頁面" description="找不到這個豆腐岩頁面。" noindex>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-28 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <p class="section-kicker">404</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-black text-ink-900">這塊豆腐岩不在這裡</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-ink-900/70">頁面可能已移動，回到首頁重新選擇行程、交通或照片牆。</p>
    <a href="/" class="mt-8 inline-flex rounded-full bg-river-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-black text-tofu-50">回首頁</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
